# Shell scripts and git hooks must stay LF so they run under POSIX shells
# (a CRLF shebang breaks `#!/usr/bin/env bash` with "bad interpreter").
# This machine sets core.autocrlf=true, so without these rules a fresh clone
# checks the hook out with CRLF and the R2 gate fails to start.
*.sh text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
